rvices performed by a computer's or device's operating system. These routines usually carry out maintenance tasks such as managing files and displaying information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="49642">API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354447">رابط برنامه نویسی برنامه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1124_49642_1897178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of routines that an application uses to request and carry out lower-level services performed by a computer's or device's operating system. These routines usually carry out maintenance tasks such as managing files and displaying information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="49642">API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897178">API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1124_49644_1354447"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of routines that an application uses to request and carry out lower-level services performed by a computer's or device's operating system. These routines usually carry out maintenance tasks such as managing files and displaying information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="49644">application program interface</term><termNote type