th black. A 10-percent shade is one part of the original color and nine parts black.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="111882">shade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506073">سایه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13016_346958_1499236"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of partial control parents get over the accounts and devices of their children helping them supervise how their children behave online and letting them restrict what their children see.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="346958">parental controls</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499236">کنترول های منبع</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13028_334517_2074725"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Combined earphone and microphone set that enables hands-free communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="334517">headset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2074725">هدسیت</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGen