ases, and existing technologies of a business or enterprise so that they function as an efficient, business-wide system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="257420">EAI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354506">ادغام برنامه های تجارتی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13033_257433_1354506"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of coordinating the operation of the various programs, databases, and existing technologies of a business or enterprise so that they function as an efficient, business-wide system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="257433">A2A integration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354506">ادغام برنامه های تجارتی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13038_232525_1897486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The slide text on the slide master. The master text determines the format of text on all slides as well as the shape of text placeholders and their placement on slides.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232525">master text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897