ular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1698085">Internet Explorer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13587_25017_2485916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To combine products for sale as a lot. Frequently, operating system software and some widely used applications are bundled with a computer system for sale.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25017">bundle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485916">بسته</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1360_358369_2299467"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An encoding mechanism that converts binary data into printable ASCII characters so that the data can be included in the message body without violating SMTP conventions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="358369">UUENCODE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299467">UUENCODE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13600_237376_1354480"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of exporting objects such as resources, templates, and galleries from a source system and importing them to a destination system. A common application is moving data from a development server to a production server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237376">content deployment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354480">ازهم ریختن محتوا</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13605_347939_1797447"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file or set of files that defines the data structure, appearance, and behavior of a form.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="347939">form template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1797447">الگوی فورمه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1362_360135_1897572"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that summarizes and analyzes data in a datasheet or form. You can use different levels of detail or organize data by dragging the fields and items, or by showing and hiding items in the drop-down lists for the fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360135">PivotTable view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897572">نمای PivotTable</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1363_149014_2299415"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report contained within another report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149014">subreport</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299415">راپور فرعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13638_312148_2298901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows-based directory service that stores information about objects on a network and makes this information available to users and network administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="312148">Active Directory Domain Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298901">دایریکتوری فعال</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="13638_312148_2298912"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows-based directory service th