oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1520189">خط افقی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14763_141747_1897296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that enables a user to sample the color of any pixel on a screen and apply that color to an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141747">eyedropper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897296">قطره چکان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14766_11020_1506112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To assign or reserve a portion of an element, such as a resource or a session, for a particular use or purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="11020">allocate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506112">اختصاص دادن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1477_149955_2737266"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The API that d