g objects and SmartArt graphics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237296">Quick Styles</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506158">شیوه های سریع</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16225_232420_1506159"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secure email feature that lets you add sensitivity labels, such as Internal Use Only, to the message header. Security labels in your organization are controlled by security policies set up by your email administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232420">security label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506159">لیبل امنیتی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16250_174770_1897390"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rectangle with sizing handles that surrounds a selected object or objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="174770">selection rectangle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897390">مستطیل انتخاب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16250_645093_1897390"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rectangle with sizing handles that surrounds a selected object or objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="645093">selection box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897390">مستطیل انتخاب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16263_10901_1498647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To position objects or text relative to some point, such as the page margin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="10901">align</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498647">همراستا کردن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16268_148817_1897363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fundamental data type that holds characters, one character per 2 bytes. A fixed-length string can contain 1 to 64K characters; a variable-length string can contain 1 to 2 billion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148817">String data type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897363">نوع ارقام رشته ای</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16276_263115_1506160"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a file format that allows for VBA code. Examples of file extensions for macro-enabled formats are .docm, .pptm, .xlsm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="263115">macro-enabled</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506160">ماکرو-فعال شده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16290_237379_2299066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Office Server that provides a workflow for document review.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237379">Document Review</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299066">بازبینی مدرک</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16315_140027_1498832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A dialog box that displays one complete record at a time. You can use data forms to add, change, locate, and delete records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140027">data form</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498832">صورت داده ها</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16317_209984_1499115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Media Player, a database that contains information about digital media files on a computer, a network drive, or the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="209984">library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499115">لایبریری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16319_119343_1796260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One or more rows of cells commonly used to display numbers and other items for quick reference and analysis.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="119343">table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796260">جدول</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16322_143641_1897315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cell in which each input value from a data table is substituted. Any cell on a worksheet can be the input cell. Although the input cell does not need to be part of the data table, the formulas in data tables must refer to the input cell.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143641">input cell</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897315">خانۀ دخولی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16327_163539_1506161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The adjustment of the spacing between two characters to create the appearance of even spacing, fit text to a given space, and adjust line breaks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="163539">kerning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506161">فاصلۀ حروف</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16337_117385_1499465"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One character (or more) printed slightly below the baseline of surrounding text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="117385">subscript</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499465">متن فرعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16338_210449_1897427"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The core component of the Excel Server that includes the full Excel calculation functionality. It loads and saves Excel workbooks, queries and refreshes external data, calculates workbooks, and provides the calculated results to the caller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210449">Excel Calculation Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897427">سرور محاسبه Excel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16344_18758_1498683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the context of processes or tasks that are part of an operating system or program, operating without interaction with the user while the user is working on another task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="18758">background</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498683">گذشته</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16348_318717_1498935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To advance audio or video playback at a speed that is faster than normal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318717">fast forward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498935">پیش راندن سریع</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16358_210492_1499255"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of attack that tries to trick users into revealing personal information, such as credit card numbers, bank accounts, or passwords, often using links to fake websites included in emails and chat messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210492">phishing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499255">فیشینگ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16363_536538_1354659"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ASP.NET Web page that includes Web Parts controls that let users personalize the page, such as selecting the information to display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="536538">Web Parts page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354659">صفحۀ بخش های وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16363_747618_1354659"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An ASP.NET Web page that includes Web Parts controls that let users personalize the page, such as selecting the information to display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747618">Web Part Page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354659">صفحۀ بخش های وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338551_1796237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338551">privilege attribute certificate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796237">PAC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16365_338565_1796237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item provided and signed by the DCE security server that is both a proof of identity and a list of group memberships.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338565">PAC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796237">PAC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16386_568102_1354443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft deployment and management tool for high availability Web applications built on the Microsoft Windows operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="568102">Application Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354443">Application Center</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16387_568108_1897615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report, accessible from the Web Author, that generates a list of all pages waiting for the approval of the user who is logged on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="568108">Approval Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897615">همکاری تصدیق</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16389_568136_1354452"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom group used to target content to people based on membership within the group.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="568136">audience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354452">شنوندگان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1639_148511_1505735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A workbook that is configured to allow multiple users on a network to view and make changes at the same time. Each user who saves the workbook sees the changes that are made by other users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148511">shared workbook</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505735">کتاب کاری شریک شده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16391_568169_1897616"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web page presented to unauthenticated users logging on to a site requiring authentication with a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp>