d</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21355_773106_2299169"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to insert the contents of an open window or a screen clipping into the current document without the need to utilize external applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="773106">Insert Screen Shot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299169">درج عکس صفحه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21358_773112_1897742"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that makes automatic versions of user documents during each autosave operation and allows the user to revert to previous copies of the document with ease.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="773112">Office Auto-Revisions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897742">نسخه های اتوماتیک Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21360_773163_1506230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that alerts users to potential issues with email recipients before the message is sent.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="773163">MailTips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Prop