 services that provide enhanced information and interaction capabilities with regard to people and resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777783">social networking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354622">شبکه بندی اجتماعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21573_777813_1354543"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to preview the appearance of a formatting option or command before actually applying it to selected text or objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777813">Live Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354543">پیش دید زنده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21595_778836_1897746"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of dynamically rearranging a hierarchy of SharePoint sites, typically used during a migration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="778836">reparenting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897746">تجدید سلسۀ مراتب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Nou