 or email stores.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230149">AQS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298926">AQS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25740_1403948_2299105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based management tool for Microsoft Exchange administrators and enterprise email users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1403948">Exchange Control Panel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299105">صفحه کنترول Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25740_1755528_2299105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based management tool for Microsoft Exchange administrators and enterprise email users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1755528">Exchange admin center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299105">صفحه کنترول Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25740_1756842_2299105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based management tool for Microsoft Exchange administrators and enterprise email users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1756842">Exchange Administration Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299105">صفحه کنترول Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25740_2794247_2299105"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The web-based management tool for Microsoft Exchange administrators and enterprise email users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2794247">EAC</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299105">صفحه کنترول Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25741_1186781_2299206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary navigation tab for mail flow management features in Outlook Live: Transport rules, called “rules” in Outlook Live service; Supervision policies, including closed campus supervision policy and bad words supervision policy, and anti-bullying supervision policy; IP safelisting; Domain types: hosted or shared.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1186781">Mail Control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299206">کنترول نامه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25742_1186782_2299237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Web-based management interface for Live@edu administrators. Administrators enroll their domain there initially, and then use the portal to keep their contact information up to date; access DNS record information; view the status of enrolled domains; manage IP safelists; request support for single sign-on; submit or escalate a support request; link to all other resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1186782">Microsoft Live@edu Service Management Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299237">پورتل مدیریت سرویس Microsoft Live@edu</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25743_1186784_2299420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of email policy settings that can help primary and secondary school administrators comply with some requirements of the Children's Internet Protection Act (CIPA). Using these policy settings, administrators can control who can send email to and receive email from the users in their organization, and filter and reject email that contains objectionable words.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1186784">supervision policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299420">پالیسی نظارت</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25744_1187169_2298984"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">E-mail policy settings that apply inbound and outbound email restrictions so students can send email to or receive email from addresses inside the organization only. Administrators can set up organization-wide exceptions so email can be sent to or from specific domains and public groups. Administrators can also configure per-user exceptions so students can send email to and receive email from specific addresses outside the organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187169">closed campus supervision policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298984">پالیسی نظارت کمپ بسته</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25745_1187170_2298923"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email policy that administrators use to prevent a bully from sending email messages to specific people by adding the bully's email address as an entry on the "victim's" supervision list. This functionality supports anti-harassment policies in schools and other organizations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187170">anti-bullying supervision policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298923">پالیسی نظارت ضدقلدری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25747_1188776_2299419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual item on the list of email addresses or users that are subject to or excepted from the actions of the closed campus supervision policy or anti-bullying supervision policy. For example, a bully's email address would be an entry on the supervision list of a "victim", and a parent's email address might be added as an entry on the supervision list of their child, who is a student subject to the closed campus supervision policy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188776">supervision list entry</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299419">ورودی لست نظارت</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25748_1188777_2299418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The list of email addresses or users that are subject to or excepted from the actions of the closed campus supervision policy or anti-bullying supervision policy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188777">supervision list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299418">لست نظارت</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25749_1188778_2298947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">E-mail policy settings that prevent sending and receiving email that has specifically banned content. Administrators can use this policy to reject email that contains profanity or other objectionable words, also known as "bad words".</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188778">bad word supervision policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298947">پالیسی نظارت الفاظ نامناسب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25750_1188779_2299248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of user accounts that are being submitted in a CSV file for migration from an on-premises messaging system to an email system in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188779">migration batch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299248">دسته انتقال</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25751_1188780_2299249"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The action of submitting a migration batch for migration from an on-premises messaging system to an email system in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188780">migration batch request</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299249">تقاضای دسته انتقال</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25752_1188782_1531117"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A threshold in the Resource Throttling feature that specifies the maximum number of items that a database operation can involve at one time. Operations that exceed this limit are prohibited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188782">List View Threshold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531117">آستانۀ دید لیست</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25753_1188783_2299032"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The time span between the start and end dates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188783">date range</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299032">محدوده تاریخ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25758_1207866_1897948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Analytic tools and processes that enable users in an organization to access data to create, use, and share reports without relying on IT for report creation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1207866">self-service business intelligence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897948">دانش تجاری برای کارمندان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25758_1999171_1897948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Analytic tools and processes that enable users in an organization to access data to create, use, and share reports without relying on IT for report creation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1999171">self-service BI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897948">دانش تجاری برای کارمندان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25768_1216600_1531123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A shared service that publishes a term store and, optionally, a set of content types.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216600">managed metadata service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531123">خدمات مورد دادۀ اداره شده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25770_1216602_2156887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SharePoint service application that is deployed and managed on premises and that enables enterprise search functionality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216602">Search service application</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2156887">برنامه خدمات جستجو</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25772_1216604_1531195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service application in SharePoint Server that provides unattended, server-side conversion of documents into formats that are supported by the Microsoft Word client application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216604">Word Automation Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531195">خدمات خودکاری Word</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25773_1216605_1531197"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint service that enables viewing of Word documents from a Web browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216605">Word Viewing Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531197">خدمات دیدن Word</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25779_1216616_2298916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A universal security group with administrative rights assigned to it. These administrative rights are specified by built-in management roles, which are part of the role-based access control (RBAC) permissions model in Exchange Server 2010.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216616">administrator role group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298916">گروه نقش سرپرست</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25779_1216616_2299364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A universal security group with administrative rights assigned to it. These administrative rights are specified by built-in management roles, which are part of the role-based access control (RBAC) permissions model in Exchange Server 2010.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216616">administrator role group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299364">گروه نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25779_1230147_2298916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A universal security group with administrative rights assigned to it. These administrative rights are specified by built-in management roles, which are part of the role-based access control (RBAC) permissions model in Exchange Server 2010.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230147">role group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298916">گروه نقش سرپرست</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25779_1230147_2299364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A universal security group with administrative rights assigned to it. These administrative rights are specified by built-in management roles, which are part of the role-based access control (RBAC) permissions model in Exchange Server 2010.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1230147">role group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299364">گروه نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25780_1216617_2299362"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of one or more end-user management roles that enable users to manage the settings of their Outlook Live account and public groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216617">role assignment policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299362">پالیسی تخصیص نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25782_1216619_2299053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system mailbox in which copies of the mailbox search results are stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216619">discovery mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299053">صندوق پستی اکتشاف</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25782_2603788_2299053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system mailbox in which copies of the mailbox search results are stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2603788">discovery system mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299053">صندوق پستی اکتشاف</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25782_2604808_2299053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system mailbox in which copies of the mailbox search results are stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2604808">eDiscovery mailbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299053">صندوق پستی اکتشاف</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25783_1216620_2299173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of IP addresses that are in a gateway servers list or internal mail servers list of IP addresses that should not be treated as spam.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216620">IP safelist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299173">لست IP مصئون</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25783_1216620_2299373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of IP addresses that are in a gateway servers list or internal mail servers list of IP addresses that should not be treated as spam.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216620">IP safelist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299373">لست مصئون</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25783_1216842_2299173"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of IP addresses that are in a gateway servers list or internal mail servers list of IP addresses that should not be treated as spam.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216842">safelist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299173">لست IP مصئون</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25783_1216842_2299373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of IP addresses that are in a gateway servers list or internal mail servers list of IP addresses that should not be treated as spam.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216842">safelist</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299373">لست مصئون</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25784_1216621_2299363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The individual entry on a management role. Role entries provide access to cmdlets, scripts, and other special permissions that let users perform a specific task. A role entry is often a single cmdlet and the parameters that members of a role group can run when the role is assigned to the role group.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216621">role entry</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299363">ورودی نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25785_1216622_2299366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The scope of influence or impact of a role assignment. The scope defines what objects a role group member can manage. In Outlook Live, there is the recipient scope and the configuration scope.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216622">role scope</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299366">محدوده نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25786_1216623_2299365"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of an administrator role group, which is a universal security group with administrative rights assigned to it. The roles assigned to the role group are applied to each member who is added to the role group. This grants each user all the permissions allowed by the roles assigned to the role group.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216623">role group member</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299365">عضو گروه نقش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25787_1216679_1527171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link to the Microsoft service agreement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216679">Terms of use</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527171">شرایط استفاده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25798_1216733_1527164"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link to the personal page where users can store information (such as personal interests) and links (such as to friends and photos).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216733">Profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527164">پروفایل</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2580_141226_1498893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A shaded outline that appears behind an object or text and creates the illusion of depth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141226">drop shadow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498893">سایه افتاده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2580_141226_1499402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A shaded outline that appears behind an object or text and creates the illusion of depth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141226">drop shadow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499402">سایه</t