al network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657988">شبکۀ اجتماعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_2696313_1657988"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696313">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657988">شبکۀ اجتماعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26004_1256406_1506274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short summary of the contents of a document that gives the reader a quick overview of its topic and purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256406">abstract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506274">خلاصه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26007_1256417_1531132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cache that is used internally to optimize page rendering by storing properties of sites, page layouts, and pages. It reduces the amount of traffic between the Web server and a SQL database. This results in higher throughput of rendered pages, thereby increasing the number of pages that can be delivered to clients.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256417">object cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531132">نهانگاه شیی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26050_1262328_2803257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To merge information from multiple places into one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262328">consolidate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2803257">یکپارچه کردن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26062_1262341_1897958"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that enables users to view (in full fidelity) and share Visio files in SharePoint Server without having the Visio client installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262341">Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897958">دسترسی ویب Visio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26062_1275257_1897958"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that enables users to view (in full fidelity) and share Visio files in SharePoint Server without having the Visio client installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275257">Visio Web Access Web Part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897958">دسترسی ویب Visio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26073_1262378_1897959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of features that incorporates elements of social networking into the Outlook experience. It provides relevant contextual information about the people whom users interact with in Outlook, based on local data (email and calendar items) and social activity (news feeds and status updates).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262378">Outlook Social Connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897959">ارتباط دهنده اجتماعی Outlook</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote