oun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27311_1375269_1527222"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action considered to have social relevance and that might appear in an activity feed. For example, photo activity and status updates are considered to be socially relevant.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1375269">update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527222">بهنگام آوری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27346_1370438_2335827"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fault that occurs when a page sought in the file system cache is not found and must be retrieved from disk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370438">hard fault</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335827">نقص مرتبط به هارد</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="27346_1370438_2335828"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fault that occurs when a page sought in the file system cache is not found and must be retrieved from disk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1370438">hard fault</term><termNote ty