>anti aliasing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898248">صاف کردن خطوط</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28773_1496239_2298908"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The stage during the email migration when the migration service is actively provisioning new cloud-based mailboxes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496239">active mailbox migration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298908">انتقال صندوق پستی فعال</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28774_1496240_2298914"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An auditing record that records any action, based on a Windows PowerShell cmdlet, performed by an administrator. This can help the administrator troubleshoot configuration issues or identify the cause of security- or compliance-related problems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496240">administrator audit log</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2298914">ثبت وقایع بازرسی سرپرست</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28775_1496241_1531127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Web-based team collaboration environment that provides the ability to create and access virtual workspaces for managing documents, discussions, lists, surveys and other important contextual information, such as team member status and presence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496241">Microsoft SharePoint Foundation 2010</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531127">Microsoft SharePoint Foundation 2010</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28777_1496243_2299022"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email migration process that provisions new cloud-based mailboxes and then migrates mailbox data to the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496243">cutover migration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299022">انتقال مکمل</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28778_1496244_2299094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of message journaling in which the original unaltered message is included as an attachment in the journal report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496244">envelope journaling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299094">ثبت پبام پوشش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28779_1496245_2299140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A template applied to the distribution group names in your Microsoft Exchange organization. Specifically, you can specify that a prefix, a suffix, or both be applied to all distribution group names. You can also block certain words from being used in the names.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496245">group naming policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299140">پالیسی مسمی کردن گروه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28780_1496246_2299165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In email migration, the stage when the mailboxes in the on-premises Exchange organization and the corresponding cloud-based mailboxes are synchronized every 24 hours, after the initial synchronization. This means that any new messages sent to the mailboxes on the Exchange server are copied to the corresponding cloud-based mailboxes. Incremental synchronization continues until the administrator completes the overall migration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496246">incremental synchronization</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299165">همگام سازی افزایشی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28781_1496247_2299177"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The message that is generated when a message matches a journal rule. The body of the journal report contains information from the original message such as the sender email address, message subject, message-ID, and recipient email addresses. The journal report also includes the original unaltered message as an attachment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496247">journal report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299177">راپور ثبت پیام</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28782_1496248_2299178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Exchange rule that is used to record the email messages sent to or from specific recipients.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496248">journal rule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299178">قانون ثبت پیام</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28784_1496250_2299403"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of email migration that migrates a subset of on-premises mailboxes to the cloud. This type of migration allows the admin to maintain coexistence between their on-premises and cloud-based email organizations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496250">staged migration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299403">انتقال مرحله بندی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28785_1496251_2299033"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of saving only one copy of duplicate items in the search results</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496251">deduplication</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299033">حذف دیتای زاید</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28786_1496252_2299157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique user identifier that must not change for the user over the lifetime of the user being in the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1496252">immutable ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299157">شناسه ساکت ناشدنی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2879_237829_2741618"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An alpha-numeric identifier for a marketing campaign that is distinct from its name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237829">campaign code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741618">کود کمپاین</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2886_135771_2741627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UNIX-based document search and retrieval system used to query WAIS libraries for indexed files that match keywords and that can be used on individual websites as a search engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="135771">WAIS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741627">WAIS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2886_135771_2741628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UNIX-based document search and retrieval system used to query WAIS libraries for indexed files that match keywords and that can be used on individual websites as a search engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="135771">WAIS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741628">سرور معلومات ناحیه گسترده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2886_135773_2741627"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UNIX-based document search and retrieval system used to query WAIS libraries for indexed files that match keywords and that can be used on individual websites as a search engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="135773">Wide Area Information Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741627">WAIS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2886_135773_2741628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UNIX-based document search and retrieval system used to query WAIS libraries for indexed files that match keywords and that can be used on individual websites as a search engine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="135773">Wide Area Information Server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741628">سرور معلومات ناحیه گسترده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2889_30927_1498758"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An interactive controls often found in graphical user interfaces used to enable or disable one or more features or options from a set.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30927">check box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1498758">جعبۀ بررسی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28894_1499641_1650027"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operating-system installation and configuration that uses a virtual hard disk as the running operating system. There is no host operating system or hypervisor in a native-boot configuration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499641">native boot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1650027">راه اندازی اصلی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2890_81730_1499178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An input device with the following features: a flat-bottomed casing designed to be gripped by one hand; one or more buttons on the top; a multidirectional detection device (a ball, laser or optical device) on the bottom; and a cable or wireless connection to the computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81730">mouse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499178">موشواره</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29_45263_1505688"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mark placed over, under, or through a character, usually to indicate a change in phonetic value from the unmarked state.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="45263">diacritical mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505688">آوا نما</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29_45264_1505688"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mark placed over, under, or through a character, usually to indicate a change in phonetic value from the unmarked state.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termG