ent that encapsulates user interface and related functionality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507082">Web control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531190">کنترول وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29303_1507083_1531191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An individual comment that is added within a Web discussion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507083">Web discussion comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531191">تبصره بحث وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29304_1507085_1898196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hash table of key/value pairs that is used to cache and locate internal information for Web Parts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507085">Web Part cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898196">حافظۀ نهان بخش ویب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29305_1507086_1531193"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An element in a Web Parts page that defines a provider-consumer data relationship between two Web Parts. When a Web Parts page is rendered, data provided by one Web Part can affect how and what is rendered by the other Web Part.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507086">Web Part connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531193">اتصال بخش وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29307_1507088_1531194"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A configurable characteristic of a Web Part that determines the behavior of the Web Part.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507088">Web Part property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531194">خصوصیت بخش وب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29309_1507090_1898197"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A string that identifies a Web Part zone on a Web Parts page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507090">Web Part zone identifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898197">شناسایی کنندۀ ساحه بخش ویب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29310_1507091_1898198"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An integer that specifies the relative position of a Web Part in a Web Part zone. Web Parts are positioned from the smallest to the largest zone index. If two or more Web Parts have the same zone index, they are positioned adjacent to each other in an undefined order.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507091">Web Part zone index</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898198">فهرست ساحه بخش ویب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29311_1507093_1898200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that runs a work item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507093">work item process</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898200">پروسس فقره کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29312_1507094_1898201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A GUID that is used to identify a work item type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507094">work item type identifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898201">شناسایی کنندۀ نوع فقره کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29313_1507095_1531199"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains a byte stream representation of a workbook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507095">workbook file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531199">پروندۀ کتاب کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29314_1507096_1898202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that is associated with a workbook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507096">workbook object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898202">شئ کتاب کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29315_1507097_1531200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A single cell that is designated to receive input from a user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507097">workbook parameter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531200">پارامتر کتاب کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29316_1507098_1898203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of display settings, such as the height and width, for the windows in a workbook.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507098">workbook view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898203">نمای کتاب کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29317_1507099_1531201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An association of a workflow template to a specific list or content type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507099">workflow association</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531201">وابستگی جریان کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29318_1507100_1898204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An implementation-specific file that is a part of a workflow. The workflow configuration file contains information that is necessary to create a workflow template from the specified workflow markup and rules files, and to associate it to a specific list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507100">workflow configuration file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898204">فایل تنظیمات جریان کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29320_1507102_1898205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list item that stores information about the current status of, and past actions for, a document or item that is associated with a workflow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507102">workflow history item</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898205">فقره سابقه جریان کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29321_1507103_1531202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that stores the history of actions or tasks for a business process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507103">workflow history list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531202">لیست تاریخچۀ جریان کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29322_1507104_1898206"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A GUID that is used to identify a workflow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507104">workflow identifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898206">شناسایی کنندۀ جریان کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29323_1507105_1898207"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains markup to specify the functional behavior of a workflow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507105">workflow markup file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898207">فایل نشانه گذاری جریان کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29324_1507106_1531203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action or task in a sequence that is related to a built-in or user-defined business process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507106">workflow task</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531203">وظیفۀ جریان کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29325_1507107_1898208"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that stores the sequence of actions or tasks for a business process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507107">workflow task list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898208">لست ترتیب جریان کاری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29326_1507108_1898209"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart image that is embedded in a worksheet or chart sheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507108">worksheet image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898209">تصویر ورق کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29327_1507109_1898210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that is associated with a worksheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507109">worksheet object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898210">شئ ورق کار</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29330_1507112_1898211"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that is native to an application and is made available for use in formulas.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507112">built-in function</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898211">عملکرد داخلی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29331_1507113_1531061"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special SharePoint site where an administrator can manage all sites and servers in a farm that is running Microsoft® SharePoint® Products and Technologies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507113">Central Administration site</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531061">سایت سرپرستی مرکزی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29332_1507114_1898212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of keyword consumers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507114">keyword consumer group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898212">گروه مصرف کننده کلمه کلیدی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29333_1507115_1898213"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of information that is stored in a log file for a transaction. Log levels can be represented by numbers or by words from the most to the least verbose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507115">log level</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898213">سطح ثبت وقایع</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29334_1507116_1531163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A complete set of conditions that are used to generate search results, including query text, sort order, and ranking parameters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507116">search query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1531163">جستار جستجو</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29336_1507118_1898214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report that is generated from query log information. For example, a search query log report might include the number of queries that were executed every day over the past thirty days.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507118">search query log report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898214">راپور وقایع استعلام جستجو</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29337_1507119_1898215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user search security filter that specifies group and user permissions for a specific FAST Search user. FAST Search Authorization (FSA) filters out inappropriate search results by intersecting the user’s query with the user's search security filter, and checking each document’s access control list to determine if the user has permission to view that document. The user search security filter is FSA's primary means of enforcing document-level security ("security trimming"), which helps to ensure that search results display only documents that the user has permissions to read.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507119">user search security filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898215">فلتر امنیت جستجوی استفاده کننده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29338_1507120_1898216"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The condition of a Web Part and the Web Part chrome surrounding it. Possible values are zero (0) for normal state or one (1) for minimized state.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507120">Web Part chrome state</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898216">وضعیت کروم بخش ویب</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29339_1507121_1898217"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A default group of users on a SharePoint site. By default, the Visitors group is assigned the Read permission level.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507121">Visitors group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1898217"