s a PDF document as a single or series of pictures in a page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042666">PDF Render</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065494">تبدیل PDF به عکس</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35608_2042671_2065495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables IT administrators to move Personal Folders files (.pst) to a mailbox in Office 365. A .pst file is a data file that stores your messages and other items on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042671">PST import</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2065495">وارد کردن PST</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35632_2045864_2052079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A HIP challenge that requires a user to view an image and then type a set of characters contained in that image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2045864">visual challenge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052079">چالش صوتی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35633_2045865_2052083"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security task that a user must complete to verify they are a human and not a machine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2045865">challenge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052083">چالش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35636_2277612_2281531"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office 365 subscription service for nonprofit organizations (up to 5 PCs, Macs, or mobile devices) that includes Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Outlook, OneNote, Publisher, Access, and Lync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277612">Office 365 ProPlus for Nonprofits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281531">Office 365 ProPlus برای نهادهای غیرانتفاعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35645_2046828_2601700"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">All data, including all text, sound, image files, or software, given to Microsoft by, or on behalf of, Customer or its Affiliates through use of an Online Service or in connection with Professional Services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046828">customer data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2601700">داده های مشتری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3566_134897_1499581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a disk to which content cannot be recorded.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="134897">write-protected</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499581">محافظت شده-نوشتن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3568_234787_1499565"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file backup feature that performs scheduled incremental backups of data to the target media. It also allows the user to restore an individual file or a group of files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234787">Windows Backup</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499565">پشتیبان Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35685_2052902_2071474"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A licensing mode that enables Office 365 subscribers to access their account from different computers and that allows multiple users belonging to the same subscription to log in and use their account from the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052902">shared computer activation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2071474">فعال سازی کامپیوتر شریک شده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35685_2488791_2071474"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A licensing mode that enables Office 365 subscribers to access their account from different computers and that allows multiple users belonging to the same subscription to log in and use their account from the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488791">SCA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2071474">فعال سازی کامپیوتر شریک شده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35686_2052903_2071473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email sent at a specified time to a user to remind them of an upcoming event. Users can create reminder emails for themselves for any event in their calendars and for all attendees (when users are also the organizers). The email contains all details of the event and optional notes that users might add.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052903">email reminder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2071473">تذکردهنده ایمیلی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3569_105900_1499353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The uppermost directory on a computer, partition or volume.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="105900">root directory</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499353">دایریکتوری ریشه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3569_105900_1499354"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The uppermost directory on a computer, partition or volume.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="105900">root directory</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499354">دوسیۀ ریشه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><t