er</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364194">OneNote وارد کننده</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40678_2359180_2364195"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mobile app that allows users to create a group so that members can collaborate, share messages, calendar events, files, tasks, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359180">Outlook Groups</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364195">Outlook Groups</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4068_186296_1354516"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integral Windows component that supports building, deploying, and running the next generation of applications and XML Web services. It provides a highly productive, standards-based, multilanguage environment for integrating existing investments with next generation applications and services, as well as the agility to solve the challenges of deployment and operation of Internet-scale applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="186296">.NET Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml