 type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45587_2569603_2578633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect that makes an image appear as if drawn with a pencil.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2569603">pencil effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578633">اثر مداد</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45591_2570262_2574640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The methodology, originally developed in the Japanese automotive industry, that uses digital cards to achieve just-in-time delivery and manage the replenishment cycle in a manufacturing process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2570262">Kanban</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2574640">کانبان</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4565_31042_1769880"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of finalizing a purchase on a website. For example, when customers shop on your website, they may select several items and save them in their shopping basket. When they have finished shopping, they click on a checkout link or graphical button that takes them to an online form where they enter their name, billing address, payment type, and shipping information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="31042">checkout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1769880">تکمیل خریداری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4567_232422_1897479"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The container in a navigation pane that contains shortcuts and shortcut groups.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232422">Shortcuts Pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897479">قاب راه کوتاه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45689_2575485_2578636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office feature that allows users to translate words, segments or full texts and that is powered exclusively by the cloud-based Microsoft Translator service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575485">Translator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578636">مترجم</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4569_116311_1499448"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In information processing, fixed or predetermined.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116311">static</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499448">ساکن</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45691_2575532_2591443"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An UI element that allows users to adjust the display angle of an object on the screen.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575532">angle indicator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2591443">شاخص مقیاس</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45789_2579453_2580449"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension for Cortana that connects users to custom services and solutions. Skills can be invoked on Cortana to perform certain actions, such as checking the user’s bank balance, reading a bed time story, or bookin