ross the domain. At any time, the infrastructure master role can be assigned to only one domain controller in each domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="66527">infrastructure master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299167">رئیسه زیربنایی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8120_375742_2299111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of features that provides a programming interface for accessing Microsoft Exchange data through the Client Access server role by using Web services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="375742">Exchange Web Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299111">Exchange Web Services</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8123_234529_1505930"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A graphic that indicates follow-up action is required, or otherwise identifies an important item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234529">flag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505930">بیرق</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</t