r is currently online and available, offline and unavailable, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1359311">online status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327559">وضعیت دسترسی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8570_185815_1527215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A condition of a user that can be displayed to the user's contacts to communicate whether the user is currently online and available, offline and unavailable, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185815">status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527215">وضعیت</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8570_185815_2327559"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A condition of a user that can be displayed to the user's contacts to communicate whether the user is currently online and available, offline and unavailable, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185815">status</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2327559">وضعیت دسترسی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"