at is aligned along the left margin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319131">left-aligned</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505978">همراستا شدۀ-چپ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9768_652644_1354664"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A unique name that identifies a user account to operating system. An account's user name must be unique among the other group names and user names within its own domain or workgroup.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="652644">Windows user name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354664">استفاده کنندۀ Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9775_142952_1897304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A drop-down list box control on a data access page that retrieves records from an underlying recordset based on the value you select from the list. On a grouped page, the control retrieves a specific group of records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142952">group filter control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897304">کنترول فلتر گروهی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9800_30472_1505979"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In text-based computer graphics, a block of memory addresses that correspond to character spaces on a display screen. The memory allocated to each character space is used to hold the description of the character to be displayed in that space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30472">character map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505979">نقشۀ نویسه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9805_262641_1499466"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A title animation in Windows Movie Maker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262641">Subtitle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499466">عنوان فرعی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_2727454_1499405"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727454">file share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499405">شریک</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_298002_1499405"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298002">share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499405">شریک</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9831_235026_1505980"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of confirming that data passing into the system is correct and complies with predefined rules, definitions, or parameters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235026">validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505980">معتبرسازی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9839_503120_2372711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standardized service agreement between a user and a mobile operator that establishes data service details such as pricing, types of services, and bandwidth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503120">data plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2372711">پلان دیتا</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20127_1505982"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20127">base line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505982">خط زیری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20128_1505982"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20128">baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505982">خط زیری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="985_226537_1354484"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection, storing, and sharing of information in a single system where many users can access it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="226537">content management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1354484">مدیریت محتوا</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9856_307429_2299144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of time that can elapse before the Exchange server asks a mobile device running Exchange ActiveSync to connect again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307429">heartbeat interval</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2299144">دورانیه پیوست فوری</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_145487_1505983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145487">OLE DB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505983">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_2072504_1505983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072504">Object Linking and Embedding Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505983">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_2440377_1505983"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2440377">OLEDB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505983">OLE DB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9880_142307_1897302"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A substitution that occurs when Windows or your printer uses a font similar to the one you used in your publication to display or print your publication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142307">font substitution</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897302">تبدیل کردن رسم الخط</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9884_84006_1499196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of devices that communicate either wirelessly or via a physical connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="84006">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499196">شبکه</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="989_210451_1897429"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A command that will use a print driver installed by OneNote to create an image of a wide variety of filetypes. Files are printed to the print driver and inserted as images into OneNote.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210451">File as Printout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897429">فایل به شکل چاپی</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9891_269336_1499480"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An event triggered by Windows system components that is recorded in the system log, such as the failure of a driver or other system component to load during startup.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269336">system event</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499480">رویداد سیستم</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="990_26447_1796190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system of programs and workstations used in designing engineering, architectural, and scientific models ranging from simple tools to buildings, aircraft, integrated circuits, and molecules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26447">CAD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796190">اتوکید</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="990_26448_1796190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system of programs and workstations used in designing engineering, architectural, and scientific models ranging from simple tools to buildings, aircraft, integrated circuits, and molecules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26448">computer-aided design</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1796190">اتوکید</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9900_185600_1527176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The status that users can select to indicate that they are currently busy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="185600">Busy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1527176">مصروف</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9913_234815_1499432"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item on the Control Panel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234815">Solutions to Problems</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1499432">راه حل مشکلات</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9915_183873_1897397"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Information maintained about the history of an item, including all reading and editing sessions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183873">audit history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="prs-AF"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1897397">سابقۀ تفتیش</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">AFG</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="993_72941_1499085"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The key arrangement used for a particular keyboard, including such factors as the number of keys (101 is the current standard) and the configuration of the keys (QWERTY is the United States standard). Some proprietary systems use different layouts, and many allow you to map the keys to characters according to your preferences.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="72941">keyboard layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><ter